                                "sense_id": "d8ffbc5e-3761-3233-82e2-a981e4e94d62",
                                "text": "So cam he to the chamber dore / and wold haue entryd / And anone a voyce said to hym / Flee launcelot / and entre not / for thou oughtest not to doo hit / And yf thou entre / thou shalt forthynke hit / Thenne he withdrewe hym abak ryght heuy"
                            }
